top to bottom direction
rectangle "Command / Operation\n更新系" as op #EFF3F7
rectangle "Aggregate [DDD]\n更新候補" as agg #FFF0C4
rectangle "UoW / 正本\n確定・条件検査" as commit #E9F3E7
