rectangle "Display / UI\n表示・操作" as display #EFF3F7
rectangle "Value Object [DDD]\n両系統の値の意味" as vo #FFF0C4
op -[hidden]right-> query
agg -[hidden]right-> view
commit -[hidden]right-> display
op -[#197A58]-> agg
agg -[#197A58]-> commit
commit -[#9064A5,dashed]-> event
event -[#9064A5,dashed]up-> view : 投影
